WEBVTT

00:15:28.425 --> 00:15:31.469
So, it's a wonderful new horizon,

00:15:31.469 --> 00:15:35.219
it's a wonderful thing to discover for the young

00:15:35.219 --> 00:15:37.699
and the passionate old, and that's me.

00:15:37.699 --> 00:15:39.747
So go to it!

00:15:39.747 --> 00:15:51.247
(Applause)